raiser REJECTED with the fact that HEAD has it at `dev_sh4.c:1178-1179` and the working tree's uncommitted additions shift it by 126
(Grok read the working tree in plan mode); F10 the SLEEP-under-BL filing.  Pass 2 (`pass2_20261102/`, the diff, the block after the edit,
